@startuml ISR_State_Machine
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

state "ISR Management" as ISR_ROOT {
    state "Replica States" as REPLICA_STATES {
        state "In-Sync" as IN_SYNC #C8E6C9
        state "Out-of-Sync" as OUT_SYNC #FFCDD2
        state "Catching-Up" as CATCHING_UP #FFF9C4
    }
    
    state "ISR Operations" as ISR_OPS {
        state "Expand ISR" as EXPAND #E3F2FD
        state "Shrink ISR" as SHRINK #F3E5F5
        state "AlterPartition" as ALTER #E8F5E8
    }
}

[*] --> OUT_SYNC : "New Replica"

OUT_SYNC --> CATCHING_UP : "LEO advancing\ntowards HW"
CATCHING_UP --> IN_SYNC : "LEO >= HW &&\nLEO >= Leader Epoch Start"
IN_SYNC --> OUT_SYNC : "lastCaughtUpTime >\nreplicaLagTimeMaxMs"

IN_SYNC --> EXPAND : "needsExpandIsr()"
OUT_SYNC --> SHRINK : "getOutOfSyncReplicas()"

EXPAND --> ALTER : "prepareIsrExpand()"
SHRINK --> ALTER : "prepareIsrShrink()"
ALTER --> [*] : "Controller Response"

note right of CATCHING_UP
  追赶条件：
  • Follower LEO 接近 Leader HW
  • 在 replicaLagTimeMaxMs 时间内
  • Leader Epoch 有效
end note

note left of SHRINK
  收缩触发：
  • 定时检查 (replicaLagTimeMaxMs/2)
  • 副本超时未同步
  • 不在最小 ISR 要求内
end note

note bottom of ALTER
  Controller 处理：
  • 验证请求合法性
  • 更新 ZK/KRaft 元数据
  • 广播 LeaderAndIsr 响应
  • 更新本地 ISR 状态
end note
@enduml
